### Props
| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| imageSrc | string | undefined | URL of the logo or image to paint. SVGs work best. Transparent pixels are left empty. |
| text | string | undefined | Text to paint instead of an image. Takes priority over imageSrc. |
| fontFamily | string | 'system-ui, sans-serif' | Font used for text. |
| fontWeight | number | 800 | Font weight used for text. |
| color | string | '#ffffff' | Tint of the metal. White keeps it chrome, warm tones turn it gold or copper. |
| backgroundColor | string | 'transparent' | Color behind the shape. By default the canvas is transparent. |
| density | number | 2 | How many reflection bands run across the shape. |
| softness | number | 0.1 | Softness of the reflection edges, from 0 for crisp chrome to 1 for brushed metal. |
| dispersion | number | 0.3 | Rainbow fringes where the reflections bend, from 0 to 1. |
| distortion | number | 0.07 | How much the reflections ripple as they flow, from 0 to 1. |
| edgeBend | number | 0.6 | How strongly the reflections bend around the edges of the shape, from 0 to 1. |
| angle | number | 70 | Direction the reflections flow in, in degrees. |
| speed | number | 1 | Speed of the flow. 0 freezes it. |
| scale | number | 0.6 | Size of the shape inside the canvas. |
| rotation | number | 0 | Rotation of the shape, in degrees. |
| mouseTilt | number | 0.5 | How much the reflections shift as the cursor moves, as if tilting the metal. |
| lightMode | boolean | false | Adds a soft dark rim and dims the brightest highlights so the shape reads on light pages. |
| intro | boolean | true | Pours the metal in from the outline on mount. |
| paused | boolean | false | Freezes the animation. |
| dpr | number | auto | Device pixel ratio cap. Renders at 2× or more for clean edges. |
| className | string | '' | Extra class names for the container. |
| style | CSSProperties | undefined | Inline styles for the container. |

